Subject: [PATCH] OB-4: receipts + universal correction loop

One receipt authority on the conversation spine (ConversationSession.receipt),
provenance-bound correction binding (pending -> fresh receipt -> check),
owner-applied corrections with read-back, honest OWNER_CORRECTION_NOT_SUPPORTED,
real undo only where the owner supports delete, stale receipts ask.
Fixes the Rhythm "make it Tuesday" defect generally (no phrase rule).

